<%- include('partials/head', { title: 'About' }) %>
<%- include('partials/nav') %>

  <section class="page-header">
    <div class="wrap">
      <p class="eyebrow">Our story</p>
      <h1>About <%= site.name %></h1>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="wrap wrap--narrow">
      <p class="section__intro">
        <%= site.name %> exists for one reason: to bring original, authentic perfumes and cosmetics
        into reach &mdash; no imitations, no grey-market guesswork, no settling for what happens to be
        on a local shelf. We import directly, verify what we bring in, and stand behind every bottle
        that reaches you.
      </p>
      <p>
        We don't stock everything &mdash; we stock what's worth stocking. Every fragrance in the
        collection is chosen deliberately, not ordered in bulk to fill space. That's a smaller
        selection than a department store counter, and that's the point: fewer bottles, higher
        standard, nothing here by accident.
      </p>
      <p>
        There's no call center and no script &mdash; just direct access to the people who actually
        manage the collection. Questions about a fragrance, its notes, or what's in stock go straight
        to us. Reach out from the <a href="/contact">contact page</a> or message us directly, and
        you'll get a real answer, fast.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section section--muted">
    <div class="wrap wrap--narrow" style="text-align:center;">
      <h2>Ready to look around?</h2>
      <p class="section__intro">Browse the current collection, or get in touch if you're after something specific.</p>
      <div class="hero__actions" style="justify-content:center;">
        <a class="btn btn--brass" href="/shop">View the collection</a>
        <a class="btn btn--ghost" href="/contact">Contact us</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

<%- include('partials/footer') %>
